post.description:
Search Archbee documents in docSpace. Can perform one of the 3 types of search:
1. **ai-chat** to return ai generative answer accompanied by source docs;
2. **ai-retrieval** to return just similar docs with the query;
3. **words** to perform normal search aka. "word-based"; use empty query to return all docs
4. **single-doc** to return document info by id
